        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-E2, Blacksmith Mount Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Blacksmith Trim Towel Bar is available in 3 sizes: 18 inch, 24 inch, and 30 inches. It comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. Choose from antique copper, antique pewter, or oil rubbed bronze finishes. Neither too overwhelming nor too plain, this bathroom towel bar's attention to detail is on par with even the most put together rooms.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/blacksmith-hand-towel-ring-fusion-tr-e2\"><b>Fusion TR-E2 Blacksmith Towel Ring</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/blacksmith-robe-hook-fusion-rh-e2\"><b>Fusion RH-E2 Blacksmith Robe Hook</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/blacksmith-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-e2\"><b>Fusion PH-E2 Blacksmith Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-E2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-E2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-E2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
